  "text": "A theory-building systematic review (S3) on metacognition, trust, and human-AI co-regulation in GenAI-supported foreign language learning (S3) contrasts with a study (S7) on layer-sensitive cognitive offloading in AI-assisted writing. S3 highlights the psychological processes underlying GenAI interactions, emphasizing metacognition, trust, and human-AI co-regulation. S7, on the other hand, examines the quality of AI-supported and independent no-AI writing, finding that AI-supported products did not correlate with strong independent performance. S3's limitations include the variability in study designs and the rapid evolution of GenAI technologies, while S7's limitations include the confounding of conditions with classes and the limited scope of near transfer in Week 8 assessments.",
