  "headline": "Comparing AI Integration Strategies in Education",
  "deck": "Three studies explore different approaches to integrating AI in education, from a staged introduction in formal settings to gradual normalization in higher education. Meanwhile, a systematic review and a writing study highlight the psychological and practical impacts of AI, raising questions about long-term engagement and ethical concerns.",
