  "tension": {
    "title": "Long-Term Effects of AI Integration in Education",
    "text": "While studies suggest that gradual normalization of AI use in higher education can lead to increased uptake and positive attitudes, the long-term effects and ethical considerations remain unresolved. Similarly, the systematic review highlights the psychological processes underlying GenAI interactions, but the rapid evolution of GenAI technologies and the variability in study designs limit the conclusions. How do these approaches affect sustained attention and learning in the long term, and what are the ethical implications of AI-supported learning?"
  },
  "closer": "What are the long-term effects of gradual AI integration on learning engagement and ethical considerations in higher education?"
